<p>The background worker process that comes bundled with <code>pg_partman</code> automatically detaches the old partitions that are older than 4 weeks from the main table. Since we&#x27;ve set <code>retention_keep_table</code> to <code>true</code>, the old partitions are kept as separate tables, and not dropped from the database.</p>
