olumns. Even though partitions are stored as separate physical tables, the partitioned table can still be queried as a single logical table. This can significantly enhance query performance and also help you manage the data lifecycle of tables that grow very large.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"While Postgres natively supports partitioning a table, \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"pg_partman\"}],\" helps set up and manage partitioned tables:\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Automated partition creation\"}],\": \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"pg_partman\"}],\" automatically creates new partitions as new records are inserted, based on a specified interval for the partition key.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Automated maintenance\"}],\": \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"pg_partman\"}],\" bundles a background worker process that manages maintenance tasks without needing an external scheduler or cron job. For example, it can automatically detach old partitions from the main table based on a retention policy, run \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"analyze\"}],\" on partitions to update statistics, and more.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"$L62\",null,{\"isTemplate\":false}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"This guide covers how to set up \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"pg_partman\"}],\" with Neon: why partitioning helps, how to enable the extension, how to create partitioned tables, and how to automate partition maintenance.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none border-l-2 bg-gray-new-98 py-4 pr-5 pl-[1.125rem] dark:bg-gray-new-8 border-[#2D8665] dark:border-green-52 [\u0026_pre]:px-4 [\u0026_pre]:py-3 [\u0026_pre_code]:text-sm! [\u0026_pre[data-language]]:bg-white! [\u0026_pre[data-language]]:dark:bg-gray-new-